findings.detail:
The VM changes are performance and correctness work:
- reuse of the visited bitmap and the thread lists across calls;
- a pool of capture buffers;
- skipping allocation when there are zero captures;
- a `matched` flag on captures, with every capture slot initialized;
- case-insensitive matching for character classes;
- clearing captures on transitions.
One behaviour change: `deinit` must now be called on the VM, and the tests were updated to do so. Nothing in the change is security-relevant.
